@JoborbitApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Register a new user
POST {{JoborbitApi_HostAddress}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@joborbit.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password@123",
  "displayName": "New User"
}

### Login with the seeded test user
POST {{JoborbitApi_HostAddress}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@joborbit.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Get current user (requires Bearer token from login/register)
GET {{JoborbitApi_HostAddress}}/api/account/me
Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token-here>

###
